Package: veryMAD
Title: Explicit MAD Quality Control and Robust Scaling
Version: 0.5.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Thomas", "Sirchi", , "thomasirchi@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A small R toolkit for explicit median absolute deviation based
    quality-control annotation and robust scaling of numeric vectors and
    matrices. Metrics, directions and transformations are selected by the
    user, and observations are never filtered automatically.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    cli,
    matrixStats
Suggests:
    knitr,
    quarto,
    SeuratObject,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: quarto
URL: https://github.com/Thokas99/veryMAD,
    https://thokas99.github.io/veryMAD/
BugReports: https://github.com/Thokas99/veryMAD/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
